Z||000002||theogre||12-27-2001||07:55 PM||||grand am and cutlass calais with R or U vin motors..... check the main bore diameter just to make sure they match.<P>Make sure you keep track of just which motor it came off.... functionally they are all the same but there are subtle differences if you ever have to rebuild it.<P>The air cleaners are differant on FWD. MAP mount is on "wrong" side. Otherwise they probably can be swapped. may depend on exactly which car it's in....||||reg||1
